  requesting_approval uuid [note: 'The actor that is acting in the role specified at IfcOrganization or individually at IfcPerson and requesting an approval.; ref to any; source: IfcApproval attribute 8: OPTIONAL IfcActorSelect; via select IfcActorSelect']
