  Note: 'IfcStructuralLoadSingleForceWarping: Instances of the entity IfcStructuralLoadSingleForceWarping, as a subtype of IfcStructuralLoadSingleForce, shall be used to define an action operation on a single point. In addition to forces and moments defined by its supertype a warping moment can be defined.'
