  flange_slope float8 [note: 'Slope of web of the profile. Radians; converted from the project plane-angle unit at the source boundary.; source: IfcTShapeProfileDef attribute 9: OPTIONAL IfcPlaneAngleMeasure']
  Note: 'IfcTShapeProfileDef: IfcTShapeProfileDef defines a section profile that provides the defining parameters of a T-shaped section to be used by the swept area solid. Its parameters and orientation relative to the position coordinate system are according to the following illustration.'
