  predefined_type text [note: 'Identifies the predefined types of a work calendar from which the type required may be set.; source: IfcWorkCalendar attribute 3: OPTIONAL IfcWorkCalendarTypeEnum; enumeration IfcWorkCalendarTypeEnum']
  Note: 'IfcWorkCalendar: An IfcWorkCalendar defines working and non-working time periods for tasks and resources. It enables to define both specific time periods, such as from 7:00 till 12:00 on 25th August 2009, as well as repetitive time periods based on frequently used recurrence patterns, such as each Monday from 7:00 till 12:00 between 1st March 2009 and 31st December 2009.'
  indexes {
